// A kept assignment value (plan d.2, EN0621; A:942). Shapes: c.8 (plan lines 1034-1044)
// a compound assignment to a non-Copy place is `_p = &place [compound-target]` and the
// `append` form, and a use that keeps its value is `move x` recorded in
// `meta.assign_values`.
// EN0621 head (plan e): an assignment's value can't be kept, label `s += "?"` is still
// owned by `s`.
fn kept() -> void {
  let mut _1: string; // s
  let _2: string; // t
  let _3: &string temp;
  let _4: void temp;
  assign_value bb1[1];
  bb0: {
